/* ---------- 关于 ---------- */
"About & Privacy" = "关于与隐私";
"All entries and photos stay on this device. Nothing is ever uploaded." = "所有记录和照片都留在本机，从不上传。";
"What HyperLog is for" = "HyperLog 用来做什么";
"A simple journal for hypermobile joints — log pain, flexibility changes, subluxations or dislocations with photos and notes. Entries group themselves by joint so patterns jump out. Perfect to show your physio or rheumatologist." = "一个给关节松弛人群的简记本——记录疼痛、活动度变化、半脱位或脱位，可附照片和备注。记录会按关节自动归类，规律一眼看得出。就诊时给理疗师或风湿科医生看正合适。";
"Not a medical device" = "不是医疗器械";
"HyperLog records what you experience. It does not diagnose any condition (including Ehlers-Danlos syndromes or generalized joint hypermobility). Consult a healthcare professional for medical concerns." = "HyperLog 只记录你的主观感受，不诊断任何疾病（包括 Ehlers-Danlos 综合征或全身关节松弛）。有医疗问题请咨询专业医护。";
"Privacy" = "隐私";
"No account, no network, no analytics, no ads.\nPhotos are stored inside the app's own storage.\nNothing leaves the app unless you choose to share it." = "不用账号、不联网、无统计、无广告。\n照片存在 App 自己的存储里。\n除非你主动分享，任何内容都不会离开 App。";

